<title>USA: Downey Financial says Lokey named CEO.</title>
<headline>Downey Financial says Lokey named CEO.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Downey Financial Corp said Stephen Prough resigned as chief executive officer, President and Director of Downey Financial Corp, Downey Savings and Loan Association, F.A. and their affiliated companies.</p>
<p>James Lokey was named chief executive officer and President of Downey Financial Corp. Lokey has 24 years of financial services industry experience, having served most recently as Executive Vice President and Division Manager of Wells Fargo Bank.</p>
</text>
